{"ts": "2026-05-15T02:22:39.787281+00:00", "role": "tool_result", "session": "worker_fix_d041-rollback-constraint_20260515T022107", "text": "19	For the initial seed (s42), we train for 3 epochs to obtain a full overfitting curve; subsequent seeds (s43, s44) train for 2 epochs with early stopping (patience 2 evaluations) based on validation loss. Evaluation is performed every 500 steps. We maintain dual checkpoints: $\theta^*_{\text{loss}}$ (minimum validation loss) and $\theta^*_{\text{R@1}}$ (maximum validation Recall@1).
